# pnpm-lock.yaml is intentionally tracked: without it CI/CD (Cloudflare Pages)
# re-resolves every dependency on each build and can pick up a breaking patch
# release that never ran locally (it did once — unstorage 1.17.6 broke
# prerendering of `/`). Install with --frozen-lockfile everywhere.

